{"title": "Bloodied Shrine", "pageid": 5673, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bloodied_Shrine", "categories": ["Locations", "Act One Locations"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bloodied_Shrine.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Bloodied_Shrine.png/300px-Bloodied_Shrine.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Bloodied_Shrine.png/450px-Bloodied_Shrine.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Bloodied_Shrine.png/600px-Bloodied_Shrine.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Bloodied_Shrine.png/300px-Bloodied_Shrine.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"266\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Bloodied_Shrine.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption><div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">  The Bloodied Shrine in the Shattered Sanctum  </div></figcaption></figure>The <b>Bloodied Shrine</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Location\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Location\">Location</a> within the <a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Sanctum\" title=\"Shattered Sanctum\">Shattered Sanctum</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>.  \n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>The Bloodied Shrine is a sacred place for <a href=\"/wiki/Loviatar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Loviatar\">Loviatar</a>, goddess of pain and is located east of the room where <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gut\" title=\"Gut\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Portrait_Gut.png/25px-Portrait_Gut.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Portrait_Gut.png/38px-Portrait_Gut.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Portrait_Gut.png/50px-Portrait_Gut.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gut\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Portrait_Gut.png/25px-Portrait_Gut.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Portrait_Gut.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gut\" title=\"Gut\">Gut</a> grants the <a href=\"/wiki/Brand_of_the_Absolute\" title=\"Brand of the Absolute\">Brand of the Absolute</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;334&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-21</span>.\n</p><p>The shrine is occupied by Loviatar's cleric <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abdirak\" title=\"Abdirak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png/25px-Portrait_Abdirak.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png/38px-Portrait_Abdirak.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png/50px-Portrait_Abdirak.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Abdirak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png/25px-Portrait_Abdirak.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Abdirak\" title=\"Abdirak\">Abdirak</a>. He can give the player character the permanent bonus <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Loviatar%27s_Love_(Condition)\" title=\"Loviatar's Love (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loviatar's Love\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Loviatar%27s_Love_(Condition)\" title=\"Loviatar's Love (Condition)\">Loviatar's Love</a>, provided they agree to participate in his sadomasochistic religious ritual. The buff is granted upon passing <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Intimidation\" title=\"Intimidation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Intimidation_Icon.png/25px-Intimidation_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Intimidation_Icon.png/38px-Intimidation_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Intimidation_Icon.png/50px-Intimidation_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Intimidation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Intimidation_Icon.png/25px-Intimidation_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Intimidation_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Intimidation\" title=\"Intimidation\">Intimidation</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Performance\" title=\"Performance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png/25px-Performance_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png/38px-Performance_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png/50px-Performance_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Performance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png/25px-Performance_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Performance\" title=\"Performance\">Performance</a> checks (three in a row each), or upon <i>failing</i> three <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Constitution_Small_Icon.png/25px-Constitution_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Constitution_Small_Icon.png/38px-Constitution_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Constitution_Small_Icon.png/50px-Constitution_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Constitution\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Constitution_Small_Icon.png/25px-Constitution_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Constitution_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> checks in a row.\n</p><p>If the player character has preemptively read the book titled <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/On_Receiving_Her_Grace\" title=\"On Receiving Her Grace\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/On_Receiving_Her_Grace\" title=\"On Receiving Her Grace\">On Receiving Her Grace</a> lying on the table nearby, they also have an additional option to choose a weapon which Abdirak uses on them, which alters the type of damage dealt by Abdirak. Finally, the player character participating in the ritual can also remove their <a href=\"/wiki/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">armour</a> to gain the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ardent_Apostle_(Condition)\" title=\"Ardent Apostle (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Ardent_Apostle_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ardent_Apostle_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Ardent_Apostle_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ardent_Apostle_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Ardent_Apostle_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ardent_Apostle_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ardent Apostle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Ardent_Apostle_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ardent_Apostle_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a8/Ardent_Apostle_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ardent_Apostle_(Condition)\" title=\"Ardent Apostle (Condition)\">Ardent Apostle</a> condition, which grants a <b>[+4]</b> bonus to Intimidation and Performance checks for the duration of the ritual.\n</p><p>Successful participating in the ritual grants the following inspiration:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte#A_Kiss_Without_Mercy\" title=\"Acolyte\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"A Kiss Without Mercy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte#A_Kiss_Without_Mercy\" title=\"Acolyte\">A Kiss Without Mercy</a> for party members with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte\" title=\"Acolyte\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Background_Acolyte_Icon.png/20px-Background_Acolyte_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Background_Acolyte_Icon.png/30px-Background_Acolyte_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Background_Acolyte_Icon.png/40px-Background_Acolyte_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acolyte\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Background_Acolyte_Icon.png/20px-Background_Acolyte_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Background_Acolyte_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte\" title=\"Acolyte\">Acolyte</a> background</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Entertainer#The_Art_of_Agony\" title=\"Entertainer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Art of Agony\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Entertainer#The_Art_of_Agony\" title=\"Entertainer\">The Art of Agony</a> for party members with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Entertainer\" title=\"Entertainer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Background_Entertainer_Icon.png/20px-Background_Entertainer_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Background_Entertainer_Icon.png/30px-Background_Entertainer_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Background_Entertainer_Icon.png/40px-Background_Entertainer_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Entertainer\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Background_Entertainer_Icon.png/20px-Background_Entertainer_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c2/Background_Entertainer_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Entertainer\" title=\"Entertainer\">Entertainer</a> background</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abdirak\" title=\"Abdirak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png/30px-Portrait_Abdirak.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png/45px-Portrait_Abdirak.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png/60px-Portrait_Abdirak.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Abdirak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png/30px-Portrait_Abdirak.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Abdirak\" title=\"Abdirak\">Abdirak</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grush\" title=\"Grush\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Grush.png/30px-Portrait_Grush.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Grush.png/45px-Portrait_Grush.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Grush.png/60px-Portrait_Grush.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grush\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Grush.png/30px-Portrait_Grush.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Portrait_Grush.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grush\" title=\"Grush\">Grush</a> - if no longer torturing <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Liam\" title=\"Liam\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Liam.png/25px-Portrait_Liam.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Liam.png/38px-Portrait_Liam.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Liam.png/50px-Portrait_Liam.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Liam\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Liam.png/25px-Portrait_Liam.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Portrait_Liam.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Liam\